From ee1023e527205615c6adbb30f15a86422e2ee7f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:22:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] Brand: dark daisyUI theme "brand" (BRAND_THEME=brand)
 with dark-mode fixes

Generalised from the JT patches 0002/0005/0006. Upstream's light theme stays
the default. The template builder and dropzones use the theme background
instead of hard-coded light colours, the signature preview stays on white.
